{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013Gr9tKgNgAYTvtWPnWdVxZ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# contrastive_trace_safety — Research Dashboard\n2\t\n3\t> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 20:41 UTC | 更新原因: Dream analysis complete — structural fixes applied, re-dream launched, exp-013 dispatched\n4\t\n5\t## 核心方向\n6\tReasoning model 自我越狱的 hidden-state 安全承诺检测：temporal probing 方法在覆盖率上饱和 oracle 上界（+30pp），GRU 实现正向但不可靠的提前检测（+4.7 steps, median 0）。详见 paper_framing.md。\n7\t\n8\t## 当前阶段: Research (Post-MVP, Dream 修复轮)\n9\t\n10\t**MVP 已通过** (D005): GRU h=256 multi-7L 达到 coverage 76.7% + lead time +4.7 steps。\n11\t\n12\t**Dream 首轮结果** (dream_20260516T194646): 3/6 all tiers — 结构性问题需修复:\n13\t- ❌ 缺 text-based baseline → 新增 exp-013 (P0)\n14\t- ❌ 缺 change-point detection → 新增 exp-014 BOCPD (P0)  \n15\t- ❌ 缺 FPR 分析 → 新增 exp-015 (P0)\n16\t- ❌ Related work gaps → paper_framing.md 已更新\n17\t- ❌ Title \"Contrastive\" 名不副实 → 标注改名\n18\t\n19\t**Re-dream 已启动** (dream_20260516T203948) — 验证修复是否达标。\n20\t\n21\t## 近期任务\n22\t- [ ] 等待 re-dream 结果，确认 best ≥ 4/6 且 median ≥ 3/6\n23\t- [ ] exp-013 text baseline 已派 Agent（不需 GPU，可立即执行）\n24\t- [ ] exp-005 TrajGuard baseline 执行中（r1-8b 数据）\n25\t- [ ] exp-006 bootstrap CIs 执行中（r1-8b 数据）\n26\t- [ ] 32B 模型下载进行中（r1-32b + QwQ-32B）\n27\t- [ ] re-dream 达标后：批准 exp-001 (32B extraction + layer sweep)\n28\t- [ ] exp-014 BOCPD：待 exp-001 probe scores 可用后启动\n29\t- [ ] exp-015 FPR analysis：待 exp-001/002 完成后启动\n30\t\n31\t## 实验计划概览\n32\tP0 (必跑, 19.5h): exp-001~006 + exp-013~015\n33\tP1 (重要, 8h): exp-007~010\n34\tP2 (加分, 8h): exp-011~012\n35\t详见 experiment_plan.yaml\n36\t\n37\t## GPU 预算\n38\t- 分配: 2× RTX PRO 6000 96GB (autodl-rtx6000)\n39\t- 已用: ~2h (MVP 阶段 hidden state extraction + diagnostic + GRU)\n40\t- 剩余 P0 预算: ~17.5h\n41\t- 32B 模型下载占用中，下载完成后立即可用\n42\t\n43\t## 关键时间线\n44\t- May 16: MVP pass + Dream 首轮 + 修复\n45\t- May 17-19: P0 实验（32B extraction + text baseline + BOCPD + cross-arch）\n46\t- May 19-21: P1 实验（ablations）\n47\t- May 21-25: 论文写作 + 投稿准备\n48\t- **May 25: ARR DDL**\n49\t\n50\t## 关键决策日志\n51\t\n52\t| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\n53\t|----|------|------|----------|\n54\t| D006 | 2026-05-16 | Dream review 3/6 all tiers — framing/plan adjusted | exp-013, exp-014, exp-015 |\n55\t| D005 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 完整通过：GRU h=256 multi-7L 达成 +4.7 步 lead time +  | — |\n56\t| D004 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 条件性通过：temporal 优势在 coverage（+30pp → oracle 上限） | — |\n57\t| D003 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 首次结果未过 pass gate，批准 3-4h 诊断轮（layer sweep + PCA | — |\n58\t| D002 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 重设计：从 transition localization 改为 commitment de | — |\n59\t| D001 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 设计：用 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B + HarmThough | — |\n60\t\n61\t\n62\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01AnDEHMYKA39CSFYvmhDcNC","session_id":"47a9f493-e1d7-4c88-83ab-6d41811d63f4","uuid":"c861fec5-0ef5-488e-97fd-38b9196ab197","timestamp":"2026-05-16T21:10:31.889Z"}
