{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FfKz5xiEn3iGSxWXtobQNK","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Handover — 2026-05-16\n2\t\n3\t> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\n4\t\n5\t## 运行中\n6\t（无）\n7\t\n8\t## 待处理\n9\t- exp_014_bocpd_poc: BOCPD/CUSUM on probe score sequences may detect commitment earlier than raw threshold crossing by identifying distributional shift points. Potential breakthrough for Claim 3 (pre-textual detection).（准备中）\n10\t- exp_015_fpr_analysis: Text temporal probe's high lead time (+11.5) is inflated by false positives (trigger-happy). If text FPR >> HS FPR, the early detection is illusory and hidden-state monitoring remains necessary. If FPR comparable, paper motivation needs restructuring.（准备中）\n11\t\n12\t## 近期结论\n13\t- **exp_006_bootstrap_ci** (success): Bootstrap CIs will confirm temporal methods significantly outperform static methods in crossing rate and lead time, providing statistical rigor for paper claims\n14\t  [exp_006_bootstrap_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/contrastive_trace_safety/artifacts/exp_006_bootstrap_ci/data/bootstrap_results_pointer.txt)\n15\t- **exp_013_text_baseline** (success): Text-based sentence embeddings (all-MiniLM-L6-v2) should underperform hidden-state probes on commitment detection because surface text may not reveal internal model state shifts. If text matches hidden-state performance, paper motivation needs restructuring.\n16\t  [exp_013_text_baseline_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/contrastive_trace_safety/artifacts/exp_013_text_baseline/data/results_summary.txt)\n17\t- **exp_005_trajguard_mahalanobis** (negative): Mahalanobis distance from safe trace distribution should fail as commitment detector because PCA shows discriminative signal is in minor components, not the principal directions that dominate covariance\n18\t  [exp_005_trajguard_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/contrastive_trace_safety/artifacts/exp_005_trajguard_mahalanobis/data/results_summary.txt)\n19\t\n20\t## 趋势\n21\t成功 5 / 负向 4 / 失败 0 / 共 9\n22\t\n23\t## 下一步\n24\t（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\n25\t\n26\t## 资源状态\n27\tautodl-rtx6000: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1\n28\t\n29\t## 告警\n30\t（无）\n31\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01AnDEHMYKA39CSFYvmhDcNC","session_id":"47a9f493-e1d7-4c88-83ab-6d41811d63f4","uuid":"bfd07b84-fa04-48d2-9770-2bf84af3b93f","timestamp":"2026-05-16T21:10:35.287Z"}
